@bitzerodotcom","verified":true,"businessCategory":"Entrepreneur","externalLink":"https://kevinoleary.com/tequila/","followers":2332920,"following":567,"posts":5813,"recentPosts":[{"type":"Video","date":"2026-07-27","caption":"I interviewed the LEGEND Kevin O’ Leary 🤯 I asked @kevinolearytv how he got RICH and the number one thing that keeps people broke in today’s world! I also asked him whether or not people should give money to family members after they become millionaires and his best dating advice for entrepreneurs. Lastly, I asked him the best advice he’d give the younger generation. #wealth #entrepreneur #financialfreedom #motivation","hashtags":["wealth","entrepreneur","financialfreedom","motivation"],"mentions":["kevinolearytv"],"likes":348976,"comments":4608,"tagged":["kevinolearytv","realjamesdumoulin"]},{"type":"Video","date":"2026-10-13","caption":"The fastest way to make a million dollars is to solve a problem for people. People pay you because you saved them time, money and make their lives more productive. Find a pain point that you know everyone has and then provide a product or service that solves for that.","likes":561,"comments":27},{"type":"Video","date":"2026-10-13","caption":"Protecting your gem-set watches is just as important as acquiring them. That’s why I invented Wonder Care. With Wonder Care, you can set the repurchase price to be exchange a watch back to what you bought. So if you bought a Rainbow Daytona and you lose it, you get a new Rainbow Daytona coming right back through Wrist Aficionado. That’s what the insurance does. It’s circular. You come into the circle of friendship under Wonder Care. I’ve got your back on watch insurance.","likes":516,"comments":27,"tagged":["wristaficionado","wondercareluxury"]},{"type":"Video","date":"2026-10-12","caption":"I used to say just a few years ago, the only education you should get is engineering, engineering, and engineering. I don’t believe that anymore because storytelling, photography, video editing, and creators, are changing the landscape for both large and small businesses by acquiring customers. It’s not a $48,000 career anymore, it’s more like a $400,000 career because they’re doing the contracts with multiple companies, showing them how to reduce their customer acquisition cost and increase the","likes":3973,"comments":182},{"type":"Sidecar","date":"2026-10-12","caption":"Your 20s are the most important years to start building wealth, but they’re also when some of the biggest financial mistakes happen.

Taking on more housing than you can afford. Buying things you don’t need. Putting all your money into one investment. Letting credit card debt pile up. And worst of all, waiting too long to start investing.

You don’t need to be rich to start building wealth. You need discipline, diversification, and time. Start early, invest consistently, and let compounding do t","likes":3087,"comments":29},{"type":"Sidecar","date":"2026-10-12","caption":"We survived a grilling from the Shark Tank sharks! You can listen to the full interview on the SiriusXM app right now.","likes":-1,"comments":16,"tagged":["kevinolearytv","robertherjavec","sharktankabc","daniellubetzky","mashupnicole","rashaun_williams","mashupryan"]},{"type":"Video","date":"2026-10-11","caption":"When the 1 of 1 Ohtani card goes missing for a few seconds, agent Wonderful is activated. I workout everyday for moments like this.","likes":10488,"comments":595},{"type":"Image","date":"2026-10-11","caption":"Hard to say anything about this!","location":"The KEE to Bala","likes":2663,"comments":86},{"type":"Video","date":"2026-10-10","caption":"This is a principle I’ve lived by my entire career as an entrepreneur and investor. Many managers think that if they give their number out to their employees, they may call. The truth is you want to hear from them. You want to hear the bad news first. What I found is the more people I give this number to, the less it rings. I want them to have this access because I respect them, and I want them to know that they can come to me. And in that trust, I find that most people never use it.","likes":6091,"comments":59},{"type":"Video","date":"2026-10-10","caption":"Collectibles are becoming a new alternative asset class. They’re beating the market. Michael Jackson’s jacket will probably will sell for more than $10 million. This card sold for more than $10 million. It’s the 1 of 1 Ohtani, dual patch/dual auto, and graded 9,10. So it’s probably worth more now. The Tiffany chain is 2.2 pounds of white gold and 110 carats of Tiffany diamonds. So all together, I think this beats the Michael Jackson jacket.","likes":540,"comments":32},{"type":"Video","date":"2026-10-09","caption":"Kevin was right on the money. 

